:"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0292","start":292,"end":294,"surface":"悼子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000383","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0297","start":297,"end":299,"surface":"荀息","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000382","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0302","start":302,"end":304,"surface":"君子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0333","start":333,"end":335,"surface":"荀息","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000382","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0347","start":347,"end":349,"surface":"獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000374","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0369","start":369,"end":371,"surface":"驪姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000378","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p040","text":"惠公夷吾元年，使邳鄭謝秦曰：「始夷吾以河西地許君，今幸得入立。大臣曰：『地者先君之地，君亡在外，何以得擅許秦者？』寡人爭之弗能得，故謝秦。」亦不與裏克汾陽邑，而奪之權。四月，周襄王使周公忌父會齊、秦大夫共禮晉惠公。惠公以重耳在外，畏裏克爲變，賜裏克死。謂曰：「微裏子寡人不得立。雖然，子亦殺二君一大夫，爲子君者不亦難乎？」裏克對曰：「不有所廢，君何以興？欲誅之，其無辭乎？乃言爲此！臣聞命矣。」遂伏劍而死。於是邳鄭使謝秦未還，故不及難。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"惠公夷吾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"邳鄭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000384","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"夷吾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"裏克","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000381","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0087","start":87,"end":90,"surface":"周襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000240","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0091","start":91,"end":95,"surface":"周公忌父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001729","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0103","start":103,"end":106,"surface":"晉惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"裏克","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000381","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"裏克","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000381","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"裏子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000381","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0145","start":145,"end":150,"surface":"二君一大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0161","start":161,"end":163,"surface":"裏克","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000381","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m040-0205","start":205,"end":207,"surface":"邳鄭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000384","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p042","text":"邳鄭使秦，聞裏克誅，乃説秦繆公曰：「呂省、郤稱、冀芮實爲不從。若重賂與謀，出晉君，入重耳，事必就。」秦繆公許之，使人與歸報晉，厚賂三子。三子曰：「幣厚言甘，此必邳鄭賣我於秦。」遂殺邳鄭及裏克、邳鄭之黨七輿大夫。邳鄭子豹奔秦，言伐晉，繆公弗聽。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m042-0000",